on class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-9060098407584636\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/77320.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\">👇1/1~1/15开放，跨年天子，PVP刀生存堪忧，亮点不多打完才扒衣服，待开发，乱斗倒是可以取代水丽莎了</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-8197951204568397\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/367605.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\">👇宇宙池，上不封顶，推荐同上</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-3881555135468102\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/712845.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><br></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\">👇算是WB<span style=\"\">补充池吧，只会出如下4只，上不封顶</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\">都属于现阶段必备的天子，天子都有用但不推荐强抽</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-6414520263823698\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/797799.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">👇光属性血石宇宙池，不要不要不要抽</span><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-8451087135255242\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/110224.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">👇12/29号出现的活动中期发带池，上不封顶</span><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\">发带池容易抽退坑，这期质量一般并不推荐去抽</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\">根据个人钻石数量来算8W抽不满4只就及时退出止损，3缺1抽到破产比比皆是</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-3135114826733483\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/724417.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">👇光属性宇宙池，上不封顶，别抽</span><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-46455746227865813\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_597/h_284/1069/107851/2022/11/9/989445.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-im